name horoscop
category Package
revision 56021
shortdesc Generate astrological charts in LaTeX
longdesc The horoscop package provides a unified interface for
longdesc astrological font packages; typesetting with pict2e of standard
longdesc wheel charts and some variations, in PostScript- and
longdesc PDF-generating TeX engines; and access to external calculation
longdesc software (Astrolog and Swiss Ephemeris) for computing object
longdesc positions.
